      "text": "A request in the thread:\nwhat will happen,\nApprove and Reject,\nwho decides, expiry\n(24 hours)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 105,
      "containerId": "p1",
      "originalText": "A request in the thread:\nwhat will happen,\nApprove and Reject,\nwho decides, expiry\n(24 hours)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CNQ88OzheeEOLM3Dd3eRV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 422.5,
      "y": 587.5,
      "width": 255,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 425704033,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2035832879,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792222492517,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A click: a database trigger\nchecks the decider\n(requester, admin or a\nholder of the approver role),\nthe expiry, and that it is\ndecided only once",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 128,
      "containerId": "p2",
      "originalText": "A click: a database trigger\nchecks the decider\n(requester, admin or a\nholder of the approver role),\nthe expiry, and that it is\ndecided only once",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RbTLmU41izjKk1lhypwTw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 825.5,
      "y": 598.75,
      "width": 209,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 689686081,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1545304655,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792222492517,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The waiting task is\nsignalled and reads the\ndecision back (a lost\nsignal is not a lost\ndecision)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 105,
      "containerId": "p3",
      "originalText": "The waiting task is\nsignalled and reads the\ndecision back (a lost\nsignal is not a lost\ndecision)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
